{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44271","headline":"隔汉江寄子安 · 鱼玄机","name":"隔汉江寄子安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南江北愁望，相思相忆空吟。\n鸳鸯暖卧沙浦，鸂𪆟闲飞橘林\n烟里歌声隐隐，渡头月色沈沈。\n含情咫尺千里，况听家家远砧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鱼玄机","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}